Description: Web dashboard for ROS 2 robots
 MITI shows a robot's topics in the browser: a 3D scene with the robot model,
 TF, point clouds and maps, camera images, logs and plots. It connects to
 miti_bridge on the robot, or to one beside it (miti run --bridge).
 Node.js is included. Start it with `miti run` (Ctrl+C stops it), or at boot
 with the miti service.

